{
  "title": "Zesty Crunchy Malaysian Beetroot Fried Rice",
  "description": "A halal-friendly Malaysian dish featuring cooked beetroot, perfect for a post-workout meal, with a buttery and crunchy texture. This recipe is brine-wet and flavorful.",
  "cuisine": "Malaysian",
